00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:23.920
that looks natural.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:26.240
See how close he gets on the first try.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.480
Here is another one that shows how every day fun

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.780
can lead to something bigger.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.140
Millions of people walking around with Pokemon Go

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:36.920
have been scanning real world locations for years.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.040
And that volunteer data is now powering AI

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:42.400
that can navigate without satellite signals.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.100
The system learned to understand spaces,

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:47.680
the same way players learn to find hidden creatures

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.160
on sidewalks and in parks.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:52.980
If you have Pokemon Go on your phone, keep playing as usual.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.640
The next time you are outside,

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.680
notice how the game recognizes buildings and streets.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.220
That same kind of recognition is what the new AI uses.

